class_name TreeArt
## Rex's big forest trees, shared by single trees (tree.gd) and forests (forest.gd).
## They all live in one picture, art/trees_atlas.png, packed by tools/pack_trees.py from
## art/trees_src/ (one shared picture lets the graphics card draw a whole forest in a few goes).
## Drawn one picture pixel per world pixel, like the buildings, so a 128 px tree is about as tall
## as a cottage. "region" is the tree's rectangle in the atlas, "base" is where its trunk meets
## the ground (inside that rectangle): the tree's position in the world.

const ATLAS := preload("res://art/trees_atlas.png")

